            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"The main stone face shows a top row of three arch-topped rectangular forms, with vertical separators and textured interiors. Below them are bands of repeated short strokes and V-shaped marks, plus several shallow animal-like figures including long-necked birdlike forms and elongated linear shapes. A lower panel contains a larger long-necked birdlike carving and other partial low-relief outlines.\",\n  \"avian\": {\n    \"answer\": \"present\",\n    \"evidence\": \"A clear long-necked figure with a pointed beak and small round eye is carved in the lower left part of the main stone surface.\",\n    \"box\": [\n      0.18,\n      0.74,\n      0.40,\n      0.98\n    ]\n  },\n  \"large_face\": {\n    \"answer\": \"absent\",\n    \"evidence\": \"No large human face with visible facial features appears on the main carved surface.\",\n    \"box\": null\n  },\n  \"scorpion\": {\n    \"answer\": \"present\",\n    \"evidence\": \"In the right middle area there is a small carved creature with a compact body, multiple leg-like projections, and a curved raised tail-like form.\",\n    \"box\": [\n      0.62,\n      0.21,\n      0.78,\n      0.36\n    ]\n  },\n  \"round_motif\": {\n    \"answer\": \"present\",\n    \"evidence\": \"A distinct rounded disk or oval is carved in the central panel, separate from the visible bird eyes.\",\n    \"box\": [\n      0.35,\n      0.34,\n      0.45,\n      0.42\n    ]\n  },\n  \"three_arches\": {\n    \"answer\": \"present\",\n    \"evidence\": \"Three similar arch-topped forms are arranged side by side across the top of the carved surface.\",\n    \"box\": [\n      0.04,\n      0.02,\n      0.76,\n      0.24\n    ]\n  },\n  \"limitations\": \"Strong sunlight, shadows, erosion, and partial damage make some shallow lines and animal details difficult to read.\"\n}",
